{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_call_of_the_wild","model_identifier":"spell_call_of_the_wild","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_call_of_the_wild\n\nGrovesinger call of the wild: a ring of green-gold leaves and small animal-track marks (paw and cloven hoof prints, pointing outward) that spreads across the ground from the caster to about 10 m. At rest the ring has a radius of 8 u round the caster's feet.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -12..12, y 0..0.7, z -12..12 units (0.68 x 0.02 x 0.68 m) at rest; 10 m radius at the end of `spread`. Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 48.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- none (an effect; the game applies the spell within 10 m)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `spread` | 1.5 | once | the 16 spokes run outward from 8 u to 356 u (10 m), fast then easing (55% at 0.5 s, 88% at 1.0 s), leaves and prints growing to 2.6x and turning a little; everything shrinks away over the last 0.3 s |\n\n- Each spoke is a bone `spoke_<n>` turned round Y in 22.5 degree steps; the clip moves it in the root's space, so the ring stays round at every size.\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): every cube (leaves and prints are lit flat colours).\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n- Made by the model thread (review of batch 2): the bot's batches left this wishlist entry out.\n"},"resolution":{"width":16,"height":16},"elements":[{"name":"glow_leaf_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,0.2,-10.5],"to":[1.5,0.7,-7.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[11,0,14.0,0.49999999999999994],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[11,0,14.0,0.49999999999999994],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[11,0,14.0,0.49999999999999994],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[11,0,14.0,0.49999999999999994],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,3.0,3.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0,0,3.0,3.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"e5095f93-bcf8-5803-8b4f-c357cf474188"},{"name":"glow_leaf_gold_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[0.5,0.3,-7.0],"to":[2.5,0.7,-5.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[3,3,5.0,3.4],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[3,3,5.0,3.4],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[3,3,5.0,3.4],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[3,3,5.0,3.4],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[5,0,7.0,2.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[5,0,7.0,2.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"465e8b4f-7f74-55d6-a77a-99106bb2e64f"},{"name":"glow_track_pad_1","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.0,0.05,-8.5],"to":[1.0,0.25,-6.5],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[5,3,7.0,3.2],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[5,3,7.0,3.2],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[5,3,7.0,3.2],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[5,3,7.0,3.2],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[7,0,9.0,2.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[7,0,9.0,2.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"1be1d16c-383f-5dee-9f07-2b5bd98fcc16"},{"name":"glow_track_toe_1_0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-1.5,0.05,-10.0],"to":[-0.7,0.25,-9.1],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[11,3,11.8,3.2],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[11,3,11.8,3.2],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[12,