"z":-321.51}],"uuid":"e321ad7a-33b2-5e4c-98e4-78c4fc43dbd5","time":1.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"scale","data_points":[{"x":0.6,"y":1,"z":0.6}],"uuid":"d8db97a0-f24b-5559-9b18-db3059f9f83b","time":0.0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"scale","data_points":[{"x":1.8,"y":1,"z":1.8}],"uuid":"c46bd23a-53f8-55b7-a4e5-88f435af1273","time":0.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"scale","data_points":[{"x":2.6,"y":1,"z":2.6}],"uuid":"cc63edb5-e2c9-53c7-bd55-e425c492989d","time":1.2,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"scale","data_points":[{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0}],"uuid":"a3b997cf-ac16-5bba-89e6-9fdc9dc03b03","time":1.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0,"y":0,"z":0}],"uuid":"e32b1622-6446-5f64-bdab-542144e76939","time":0.0,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"},{"channel":"rotation","data_points":[{"x":0,"y":-40,"z":0}],"uuid":"e6e61056-d7c7-5c16-acbe-1b84367a8e28","time":1.5,"color":-1,"interpolation":"linear"}]}}}],"description":"# spell_call_of_the_wild\n\nGrovesinger call of the wild: a ring of green-gold leaves and small animal-track marks (paw and cloven hoof prints, pointing outward) that spreads across the ground from the caster to about 10 m. At rest the ring has a radius of 8 u round the caster's feet.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -12..12, y 0..0.7, z -12..12 units (0.68 x 0.02 x 0.68 m) at rest; 10 m radius at the end of `spread`. Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 16 x 16, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 48.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- none (an effect; the game applies the spell within 10 m)\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `spread` | 1.5 | once | the 16 spokes run outward from 8 u to 356 u (10 m), fast then easing (55% at 0.5 s, 88% at 1.0 s), leaves and prints growing to 2.6x and turning a little; everything shrinks away over the last 0.3 s |\n\n- Each spoke is a bone `spoke_<n>` turned round Y in 22.5 degree steps; the clip moves it in the root's space, so the ring stays round at every size.\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): every cube (leaves and prints are lit flat colours).\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n- Made by the model thread (review of batch 2): the bot's batches left this wishlist entry out.\n"}